    "summary": "--- > **FleetFusion** is a next-gen SaaS platform for trucking companies to manage vehicles, drivers, > loads, compliance, and analytics. Built with the latest Next.js, React Server Components, Prisma > ORM, and Neon Postgres. \ud83d\ude80 --- \u2728 Features - **\ud83d\udea6 Dispatch Board:** Drag-and-drop load assignment, real-time status, and notifications - **\ud83d\ude9a Vehicle Management:** Maintenance, inspections, compliance docs, and analytics - **\ud83e\uddd1\u200d\u2708\ufe0f Driver Management:** Licensing, HOS, performance, and alerts"
